uard failure. It was caused by the stale frontend bundle in Slot A that still had the old client-side routing guard.\n\nAs soon as the snapshot transfer finishes, I will activate the slot and swap the overlays live.","thinking":"Considering task 995's status. The reactive wakeup mechanism indicates no polling is required; the system should resume execution automatically upon task completion or notification. Therefore, checking the log file or waiting for a notification from the background task is the correct approach.\n\n\n"}
